# 123ofnet.com

> {{ site.description | safe }}

123ofnet.com is a web portal first built in 2000 ("An easy solution to the Net !!!") and revived in 2026 as "An easy solution to AI !!!". It lists {{ directory.categories | totalLinks }} AI tools in {{ directory.categories | length }} categories. Before a tool is listed, a checker confirms its website loads and names the tool, and it re-checks every tool weekly; a person reviews anything flagged, writes the descriptions and chooses the quick picks (see [How we check]({{ site.url }}/how-we-check/)). Featured listings are marked as paid.

The complete list of every tool with links and one-line descriptions is at [llms-full.txt]({{ site.url }}/llms-full.txt).

